---
// Starter Plan Section — Suscripción para emprendimientos
---

<section id="starter" class="starter">
  <div class="glow-cyan starter__glow starter__glow--cyan"></div>
  <div class="glow-magenta starter__glow starter__glow--magenta"></div>

  <div class="container section-padding">
    <div class="starter-grid">
      
      <!-- Columna izquierda: texto emocional -->
      <div class="starter-content">
        <div class="starter-kicker">// — PARA EMPRENDEDORES</div>
        
        <h2 class="starter-title">
          EMPEZÁ<br>
          SIN EXCUSAS.
        </h2>
        
        <p class="starter-subtitle">
          Invertiste todo en tu negocio. La publicidad no puede quedarse afuera. Por eso creamos un plan accesible para que tengas contenido profesional todos los meses — sin complicaciones.
        </p>

        <ul class="starter-benefits">
          <li class="starter-benefit">
            <svg class="starter-check" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="9" stroke="url(#checkGradient)" stroke-width="2"/>
              <path d="M6 10.5l2.5 2.5 5.5-5.5" stroke="url(#checkGradient)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id="checkGradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                  <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#2fe4ff"/>
                  <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#ff3ad8"/>
                </linearGradient>
              </defs>
            </svg>
            <span>Sin contratos largos — suscribite y cancelá cuando quieras</span>
          </li>
          <li class="starter-benefit">
            <svg class="starter-check" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="9" stroke="url(#checkGradient2)" stroke-width="2"/>
              <path d="M6 10.5l2.5 2.5 5.5-5.5" stroke="url(#checkGradient2)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id="checkGradient2" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                  <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#2fe4ff"/>
                  <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#ff3ad8"/>
                </linearGradient>
              </defs>
            </svg>
            <span>Material listo para publicar desde el primer mes</span>
          </li>
          <li class="starter-benefit">
            <svg class="starter-check" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="9" stroke="url(#checkGradient3)" stroke-width="2"/>
              <path d="M6 10.5l2.5 2.5 5.5-5.5" stroke="url(#checkGradient3)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id="checkGradient3" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                  <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#2fe4ff"/>
                  <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#ff3ad8"/>
                </linearGradient>
              </defs>
            </svg>
            <span>Pensado para negocios que recién arrancan</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Columna derecha: card de precio -->
      <div class="starter-card-wrapper">
        <div class="starter-card">
          <div class="starter-badge">PLAN STARTER</div>
          
          <div class="starter-price-block">
            <!-- TODO: Pablo, reemplazá [PRECIO] por el valor en ARS -->
            <div class="starter-price">$[PRECIO]</div>
            <div class="starter-period">/MES</div>
            <div class="starter-price-note">Precio en ARS · Renovación mensual automática</div>
          </div>

          <div class="starter-divider"></div>

          <ul class="starter-features">
            <li class="starter-feature">
              <svg class="starter-feature-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none">
                <path d="M15 5L7 13L3 9" stroke="#2fe4ff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
              <span>2 flyers diseñados para historias de Instagram por mes</span>
            </li>
            <li class="starter-feature">
              <svg class="starter-feature-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none">
                <path d="M15 5L7 13L3 9" stroke="#2fe4ff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
              <span>1 reel editado profesionalmente por mes</span>
            </li>
            <li class="starter-feature">
              <svg class="starter-feature-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none">
                <path d="M15 5L7 13L3 9" stroke="#2fe4ff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
              <span>1 sesión de fotos y video en tu negocio (in situ)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="starter-feature">
              <svg class="starter-feature-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none">
                <path d="M15 5L7 13L3 9" stroke="#2fe4ff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
              <span>Material listo para que lo uses cuando quieras</span>
            </li>
            <li class="starter-feature">
              <svg class="starter-feature-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none">
                <path d="M15 5L7 13L3 9" stroke="#2fe4ff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
              <span>Sin contratos, sin compromisos: cancelás cuando querés</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <!-- TODO: Pablo, reemplazá TU_LINK_MERCADOPAGO por el link real de suscripción -->
          <a 
            href="TU_LINK_MERCADOPAGO" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="starter-cta"
          >
            SUSCRIBIRME POR MERCADOPAGO
          </a>

          <p class="starter-help">
            ¿Tenés preguntas? 
            <!-- TODO: Pablo, actualizá el número de WhatsApp -->
            <a href="https://wa.me/5492804512345" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="starter-help-link">
              Escribinos por WhatsApp
            </a> 
            antes de suscribirte.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .starter {
    position: relative;
    background: #07070b;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .starter__glow {
    position: absolute;
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    opacity: 0.7;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .starter__glow--cyan {
    top: -200px;
    right: -100px;
  }

  .starter__glow--magenta {
    bottom: -200px;
    left: -100px;
  }

  .starter-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 55% 45%;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Columna izquierda */
  .starter-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .starter-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: var(--color-cyan);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .starter-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(56px, 6vw, 80px);
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--color-white);
    filter: url(#rough);
    margin: 8px 0;
  }

  .starter-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .starter-benefits {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .starter-benefit {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #9aa0ad;
  }

  .starter-check {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* Columna derecha: Card */
  .starter-card-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease both;
    animation-delay: 0.2s;
  }

  .starter-card {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 480px;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #14151b, #0b0b10);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 36px 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  }

  .starter-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2fe4ff, #9d5cff, #ff3ad8);
    -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
    -webkit-mask-composite: xor;
    mask-composite: exclude;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .starter-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    background: linear-gradient(100deg, #2fe4ff, #9d5cff, #ff3ad8);
    color: var(--color-white);
    width: fit-content;
    align-self: center;
  }

  .starter-price-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .starter-price {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 64px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-white);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .starter-period {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #9aa0ad;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .starter-price-note {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #71757f;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .starter-divider {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .starter-features {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .starter-feature {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .starter-feature-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .starter-cta {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--color-white);
    text-decoration: none;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 16px 30px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    background: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--color-cyan), var(--color-purple), var(--color-magenta));
    box-shadow: 0 8px 26px rgba(157, 92, 255, 0.45);
    transition: filter 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .starter-cta:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.1);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 32px rgba(157, 92, 255, 0.6);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .starter-help {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #9aa0ad;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .starter-help-link {
    color: var(--color-cyan);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .starter-help-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-magenta);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* Responsive: Mobile */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .starter-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }

    .starter-title {
      font-size: clamp(48px, 10vw, 64px);
    }

    .starter-card {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .starter-title {
      font-size: 48px;
    }

    .starter-subtitle {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .starter-card {
      padding: 28px 24px;
    }

    .starter-price {
      font-size: 56px;
    }
  }
</style>
